# Metro research/planning docs — not read by any build script at build time
# (verified: grep for readFile/require/import/fetch of "docs/" across
# scripts/**, src/metro/**, src/services/googleShopping/** turned up nothing;
# every "docs/" hit in those files is a comment, not a filesystem read). Most
# of this is already caught by the `*.md` rule above, but this also drops the
# raw competitor-scrape data (docs/metro/research/data/**, csv/json, ~435KB)
# and QA screenshots (docs/metro/screenshots/**, png) that aren't markdown.
# See docs/metro/DEPLOY-CHECKLIST.md for how this was verified.
docs/

# Raw research scratch file (root-level competitor pricing scrape) — not
# referenced by any build script.
DFW_bulk-materials-pricing.csv

# Agent/session tooling state — never needed in the image.
.nimbalyst/
